pmp:ChaosMagicCommandingPersons a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "At odd moments picking persons nearby and willing them to stand, sit or move"@en, "In beliebigen Augenblicken Personen in der Nähe wählen und ihnen das Aufstehen, Sitzen oder Gehen anwollen"@de ;
    skos:definition "At odd moments the adept may pick various persons around him and make them stand up, sit down, or move around and do particular things."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:LiberNullAndPsychonaut ;
    dcterms:source "Carroll, Liber Null and Psychonaut (York Beach: Samuel Weiser, 1987; fifth printing, 1997), Liber Null, Liber AOM, Aetherics, p. 98; read in a full-text layer whose running heads carry the page" .

pmc:ChaosMagicMovingPersons a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Making other persons stand, sit, move or do particular things by will"@en, "Andere Personen durch den Willen aufstehen, sitzen, gehen oder Bestimmtes tun lassen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The capacity the exercise names: persons nearby made to stand up, sit down, move around or do particular things."@en ;
    skos:note "People stand and sit at odd moments of their own accord; the work gives no way to tell a willed rising from an unwilled one."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:LiberNullAndPsychonaut ;
    dcterms:source "Carroll, Liber Null and Psychonaut (York Beach: Samuel Weiser, 1987; fifth printing, 1997), Liber Null, Liber AOM, Aetherics, p. 98; read in a full-text layer whose running heads carry the page" .

pmc:ChaosMagicCommandingYieldsMovingPersons a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Willing people nearby to move is said to make them do so"@en, "Das Anwollen von Menschen in der Nähe soll sie dazu bringen, sich zu bewegen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The adept may make chosen persons stand up, sit down or do particular things."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicCommandingPersons ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicMovingPersons ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
